\par\par \b \uc2 Chinese yuan to stay basically stable, state media cites central banker\b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 2014\par 13:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 BEIJING, Dec 21 (Reuters) - China's yuan, or renminbi, will stay basically stable despite fluctuations, state radio cited the deputy chief of \uc2 China's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as saying on Sunday.\par \par \uc2 The yuan has been under pressure in the past month due to increased year-end dollar demand by some firms and growing market expectations of more policy easing after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  made a surprise cut to interest rates in November. Such easing is seen as negative for the yuan.\par \par \uc2 "The renminbi has so far this year moved by about 2 percent against the U.S. dollar, not yet considered a depreciation," \uc2 Yi Gang\uc2 , deputy head of the \uc2 People's Bank of China (PBOC)\uc2 , told state radio.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has gradually been exiting regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, and \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve has held stable.\par \par \uc2 "Judging from all angles, looking at the globalisation of the yuan ... we have all reason to believe that the exchange rate of renminbi will stay basically steady at a reasonable and balanced level," Yi said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has signaled it does not want the yuan to collapse, strengthening the official guidance rate, but traders said it has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  less in the spot market, which is allowed to trade 2 percent higher or lower than the midpoint on any given day. (Reporting by Chen Aizhu; Editing by \uc2 Alison Williams\uc2 ) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2014-12-21T13:18:05.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020141221eacl0093v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
